" end="01:13.540">her </span><span begin="01:13.540" end="01:15.730">first</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.120" end="01:17.050"><span begin="01:16.120" end="01:16.420">She </span><span begin="01:16.420" end="01:17.050">will</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.050" end="01:17.800"><span begin="01:17.050" end="01:17.140">And </span><span begin="01:17.140" end="01:17.260">she </span><span begin="01:17.260" end="01:17.800">can</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.800" end="01:22.330"><span begin="01:17.800" end="01:18.010">Find </span><span begin="01:18.010" end="01:18.040">a </span><span begin="01:18.040" end="01:18.460">man </span><span begin="01:18.460" end="01:18.790">who </span><span begin="01:18.790" end="01:19.300">knows </span><span begin="01:19.300" end="01:22.240">her </span><span begin="01:22.240" end="01:22.330">worth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.330" end="01:27.250"><span begin="01:22.330" end="01:22.570">'Cos </span><span begin="01:22.570" end="01:22.660">a </span><span begin="01:22.660" end="01:23.140">real </span><span begin="01:23.140" end="01:23.860">man </span><span begin="01:23.860" end="01:24.160">knows </span><span begin="01:24.160" end="01:24.280">a </span><span begin="01:24.280" end="01:24.730">real </span><span begin="01:24.730" end="01:25.450">woman </span><span begin="01:25.450" end="01:25.810">when </span><span begin="01:25.810" end="01:25.930">he </span><span begin="01:25.930" end="01:26.890">sees </span><span begin="01:26.890" end="01:27.250">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.690" end="01:34.540"><span begin="01:28.690" end="01:28.960">And </span><span begin="01:28.960" end="01:29.080">a </span><span begin="01:29.080" end="01:29.650">real </span><span begin="01:29.650" end="01:30.250">woman </span><span begin="01:30.250" end="01:30.610">knows </span><span begin="01:30.610" end="01:30.730">a </span><span begin="01:30.730" end="01:31.360">real </span><span begin="01:31.360" end="01:32.710">man </span><